<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-047" chapter-id="c-songshu-047-jiangdaosheng" source-id="s-songshu-047-jiangdaosheng-ws2190557">
  <p id="c-songshu-047-jiangdaosheng:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">又詔曰：「故晉壽太守<persName id="c-songshu-047-jiangdaosheng:p001:m0010" ref="561_ojt_vyz">姜道盛</persName>，前討仇池，志輸誠力，即戎著效，臨財能清。近先登濁水，殞身鋒鏑，誠節俱亮，矜悼于懷。可贈給事中，賜錢十萬。」<persName id="c-songshu-047-jiangdaosheng:p001:m0067" ref="561_ojt_vyz">道盛</persName>注古文尚書，行於世。</p>
</text>
